<title>PORTUGAL: Canada abandons visa rules for Portuguese tourists.</title>
<headline>Canada abandons visa rules for Portuguese tourists.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada is to drop tourist visa requirements for Portuguese nationals, the Portuguese Foreign Ministry said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Ending visa requirements of this kind is part of a wider rapprochement between Canada and European Union countries,&quot; the ministry said in a statement.</p>
</text>
